r by us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All gameplay and design decisions are fully human-made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A chaotic multiplayer golf game where zombies keep showing up and your friends make everything worse.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626000/d40e2a0fc963afe6375847fad22a0fdb8e9a8f2c/header.jpg?t=1782400757", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626000/2ef8d66edfbad0fac44baf79d8eeeecc975cb1eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782400757", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626000/2ef8d66edfbad0fac44baf79d8eeeecc975cb1eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782400757", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti / AMD Radeon RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not supported<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a stable internet connection. Microphone recommended for online co-op.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br